WEBVTT

00:03:29.288 --> 00:03:34.043
the Supreme Court ruled that the 
Black Hills had been unlawfully taken,

00:03:34.043 --> 00:03:36.504
and the Sioux were entitled 
to compensation.

00:03:37.255 --> 00:03:40.675
The amount named has since reached
over a billion dollars.

00:03:40.967 --> 00:03:43.719
But the Sioux Nation refused 
to take the money

00:03:43.719 --> 00:03:46.264
and to give up their claim
to the Black Hills,

00:03:46.264 --> 00:03:48.641
maintaining that they were never for sale.

00:03:49.308 --> 00:03:53.062
So, what should happen to Mount Rushmore
and the Black Hills?

00:03:53.854 --> 00:03:56.482
Responses to that question
are wide-ranging.

00:03:56.983 --> 00:04:01.112
